@baseUrl = http://localhost:5006
@schoolSlug = example-high-school

### Resolve a school registration page and its configured grades/sections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/schools/slug/{{schoolSlug}}

### Submit a student registration to this school only
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/schools/slug/{{schoolSlug}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedRole": "Student",
  "fullName": "Alex Example",
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "gradeLevelId": 1,
  "sectionId": 1
}
